<title>UKRAINE: Fourth Ukraine sugar beet test content 14.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Fourth Ukraine sugar beet test content 14.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The fourth Ukrainian beet test showed an average sugar content of 14.6 percent, down from 15.3 percent in the fourth test last year, Valentyn Tymoshenko, a senior Agriculture Ministry official, said on Friday.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following data -</p>
<p>			     4th 96 test  3rd 96 test  4th 95 test</p>
<p> Avg sugar content     14.6	   13.6	   15.3</p>
<p> Beet weight	     297 grams    256 grams    310 grams</p>
<p> Beets per hectare     75,000	 75,000	 82,000</p>
